        {
          "id": "failureRate",
          "kind": "range",
          "label": "Failure rate",
          "def": 30,
          "unit": "%",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "optimistic",
          "kind": "toggle",
          "label": "Optimistic update",
          "def": true
        }
      ],
      "loop": "manual",
      "prompt": {
        "zh": "做一个乐观更新（optimistic UI）的点赞列表：点击后立刻把这一条改成已赞、计数 +1，同时标记 pending，不等接口返回。模拟请求延迟 1200ms，失败概率 30%，失败时按 id 回滚到原状态并在那一条上显示「失败，已撤销」的提示。用 useOptimistic 或本地 state 实现，注意快速连点的竞态。",
        "en": "optimistic UI like button, update state immediately on click and mark pending, no await, simulated latency 1200ms, failure rate 30%, rollback by id on error with an inline error message, handle race conditions (last write wins), useOptimistic, aria-live polite for the error"
